  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme stands to support this ambition through focused interventions to develop systems, programmes, guidelines, tools and standards to effect structural changes for sustained and fully mainstreamed disability inclusive national development planning and decentralisation, multi-sectorally coordinated disability inclusion efforts, improved financial planning and budgeting, and enhanced accountability through a functional independent monitoring of government&#x2019;s duty bearing role.</narrative>
  </description>
